 {title:'SubD 概念',sub:'控制籠與平滑外形',detail:'使用控制結構定義平滑外形；此處只作概念圖示，未計算真正的 SubD 細分曲面。',make:()=>{const m=catalogMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(1.2,40,32));m.position.z=1.3;const c=new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(new THREE.BoxGeometry(2.6,2.6,2.6)),new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xa77b43}));c.position.z=1.3;group.add(c);}}
